'''HMS Princess''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.3 Update|Version 7.3]] increases health, attack power and movement speed. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.7 Update|Version 10.7]].

